onent possession count is largely definitional (steal starts a break).\n- observed_sample_and_power: n=911968; MADE_DEAD n=354564\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPS-075\n- observed_verdict: descriptive"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-015", "score": 0.082, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-015 | Study family SF-APPS-015: Player BEST/AVOID tier tendency in H2 trigger games (55 series)\n- observed_research_question: Player BEST/AVOID tier tendency in H2 trigger games (55 series)\n- auto_outcome_status: not a hypothesis test\n- observed_hypothesis: Teams and players differ in how often H2 trigger possessions land on the engine's BEST vs AVOID counter.\n- observed_result: Team AVOID% ranges 50.6% (ORL) to 6.8% (SAC); team BEST% 0.0%-15.8%.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- observed_failure_evidence: No outcome test; player samples 10-178 possessions.\n- observed_sample_and_power: min 10 poss per player\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-048\n- observed_method: trigger_table_clean.csv, 55 series 2022-2026, 179 players, 25 teams, min 10 poss.\n- observed_verdict: descriptive\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear\n- observed_notes: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_confidence: medium (0.65)\n- auto_addresses_question: RQC:RQC-001"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-075", "score": 0.081, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-075 | Study family SF-APPS-075: Extended Possession Value (direct PPP + opponent T+1 suppression)\n- observed_research_question: Extended Possession Value (direct PPP + opponent T+1 suppression)\n- auto_outcome_status: not a hypothesis test\n- observed_hypothesis: Play types and players have a real downstream (opponent next-PPP) component beyond direct PPP.\n- observed_result: 4/8 PTs downstream real: CUT Ext 1.658 (supp +0.0220), TRANSITION 1.509 (+0.0145), SPOT_UP 1.303 (+0.0124), POST_UP 1.127 (+0.0194). DRIVE downstream not real (opp ATT +0.0024). Player downstream mostly BH ns except M. M [cut; read_family for the full text]\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- observed_failure_evidence: Downstream effects are small (~0.01-0.02 PPP) relative to direct PPP gaps; player list is mostly non-FINDING after BH.\n- observed_sample_and_power: PT-level n in the tens to hundreds of thousands implied by other seq files\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPS-049\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF07"}], "n_results": 4}

